        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 288.78,
          "end": 292.803,
          "en": "about getting that entered task to the App component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 293.76,
          "end": 296.7,
          "en": "Now for that, in there I have these functions already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 296.7,
          "end": 300.81,
          "en": "now I need to pass this handleAddTask function",
