        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 300.81,
          "end": 303.273,
          "en": "to my NewTask component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 304.95,
          "end": 307.02,
          "en": "Now this NewTask component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 307.02,
          "end": 308.88,
          "en": "is in the Tasks component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 308.88,
          "end": 311.403,
          "en": "so I will need to go through that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 312.45,
          "end": 315.09,
          "en": "And that Tasks component, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 315.09,
          "end": 317.703,
          "en": "is inside of the selected project component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 318.9,
          "end": 322.74,
          "en": "so I will need to go through that component as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 322.74,
          "end": 326.22,
          "en": "And this is something that's called prop drilling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 326.22,
          "end": 329.04,
          "en": "And we'll make sure to get rid of that prop drilling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 329.04,
          "end": 331.56,
          "en": "in the next core section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 331.56,
          "end": 334.14,
          "en": "For the moment, to understand the problem with it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 334.14,
          "end": 336.99,
          "en": "we will simply do it and pass our props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 336.99,
          "end": 339.543,
          "en": "through all these layers of components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 340.86,
          "end": 344.73,
          "en": "Therefore, to get started in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 344.73,
          "end": 349.2,
          "en": "let's pass handleAddTask as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 349.2,
          "end": 351.51,
          "en": "to the SelectedProject component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 351.51,
          "end": 353.7,
          "en": "by adding a new prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 353.7,
          "end": 355.86,
          "en": "which could be named onAddTask",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 355.86,
          "end": 359.64,
          "en": "and which now receives this handleAddTask function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 359.64,
          "end": 360.723,
          "en": "as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 364.53,
          "end": 367.093,
          "en": "We can also already add onDeleteTask",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 368.13,
          "end": 370.03,
          "en": "and set this equal to handleDeleteTask",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 371.13,
          "end": 374.46,
          "en": "because this of course will also in the end be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 374.46,
          "end": 376.263,
          "en": "from inside this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 379.362,
          "end": 380.64,
          "en": "or to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 380.64,
          "end": 382.17,
          "en": "not from this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 382.17,
          "end": 385.08,
          "en": "but from a component used inside of this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 385.08,
          "end": 387.99,
          "en": "And therefore we need to forward these props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 387.99,
          "end": 389.673,
          "en": "through this component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 391.8,
          "end": 395.23,
          "en": "So next, let's go to SelectedProject here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 396.51,
          "end": 399.42,
          "en": "and extract these newly added onAddTask",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 399.42,
          "end": 402.33299999999997,
          "en": "and onDeleteTask props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 403.74,
          "end": 405.78,
          "en": "But now, as mentioned, we don't need them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 405.78,
          "end": 409.443,
          "en": "Instead we just forward them to the Tasks component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 410.67,
          "end": 413.34000000000003,
          "en": "So here I'll add a onAdd prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 413.34000000000003,
          "end": 415.113,
          "en": "and set this equal to onAddTask.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 416.4,
          "end": 417.93,
          "en": "And I'm using different names here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 417.93,
          "end": 420.09,
          "en": "to make this a bit less confusing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 420.09,
          "end": 421.65,
          "en": "And add a onDeleteTask prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 421.65,
          "end": 425.133,
          "en": "which receives the onDeleteTask task prop we just extracted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 427.38,
          "end": 428.36,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 428.36,
          "end": 431.41,
          "en": "we can and should go on to the Tasks component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 432.27,
          "end": 436.031,
          "en": "and there use destructuring to get that onAdd",
          "zh": ""
        },
